@startuml
title Correction and reversal with approval
actor OwnerOrManager
actor Reviewer
participant CorrectionUseCase
participant Authorization
database Store
participant Journal
OwnerOrManager -> CorrectionUseCase: submit correction referencing original
CorrectionUseCase -> Authorization: owner/manager and same group?
CorrectionUseCase -> Store: save pending; original unchanged
Reviewer -> CorrectionUseCase: approve correction
CorrectionUseCase -> Store: validate pending and unreversed amount
Store -> Journal: append compensating entry once, atomically
Journal --> Store: committed
note right of Store: Reversal ≤ original unreversed amount. Rejected/pending has no financial effect.
@enduml
